        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="34" value="V1 required architecture optimizations&#xa;1. Map/frontier positional encoding&#xa;2. Cross-attention residual + LayerNorm&#xa;3. Preserve raw frontier_features before heads&#xa;4. Shared Output MLP before logit/theta heads&#xa;5. Unit theta direction + softplus kappa&#xa;6. Strict mask for softmax, entropy, logprob, pooling&#xa;7. Separate final value MLP&#xa;8. Conservative logit and low-kappa initialization" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
